# Claude Code: personal settings and session files, and what agent-review writes during a local review.
# Of agent-review's files, only the learning store (learnings/feedback.jsonl and learnings/learnings.yml)
# is meant to be committed. A metrics commit, for one, would move a PR's head past the commit its report
# covers, and the approval would then decline.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/review/index/
.claude/review/metrics/
.claude/review/learnings/findings.json
.claude/review/learnings/pending/
.claude/review/evals/results/*
!.claude/review/evals/results/.gitkeep
